/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In the European Union, the Corporate Sustainability Reporting Directive \(CSRD\) requires companies to disclose sustainability information, covering environmental, social and governance topics. In July 2023 the European Union adopted as Delegated Act twelve European Sustainability Reporting Standards \(ESRS\). E1 Climate Change covers the topical disclosures and must be applied in conjunction with ESRS 1 General Requirements and ESRS 2 General Disclosures. ESRS E1 directly references and adopts the Corporate Standard \(2004\) and Scope 3 Standard \(2011\). )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [0 1 2]
>>
